<title>USA: Piper Jaffray opening Chicago office.</title>
<headline>Piper Jaffray opening Chicago office.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc said Friday it opened a new corporate finance office in Chicago.</p>
<p>Piper Jaffray now has five corporate finance offices. The others are in Minneapolis, Seattle, Menlo Park, Calif., and Kansas City, Mo.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
